<title>FRANCE: French experts say Buba tough as ever on EMU.</title>
<headline>French experts say Buba tough as ever on EMU.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French-based economists said on Wednesday they were surprised by the strength of a Bundesbank rejection of German government plans to revalue gold reserves and this showed how determined the central bank was to stick to a strong line on the Maastricht monetary union criteria.</p>
</text>
